[00:10.080]You know the bed feels warmer
{"你明白独自躺在这床上更温暖"}
[00:12.610]Sleeping here alone
{"独自入眠的夜晚"}
[00:16.990]You know I dream in colour
{"你明白我的梦境绚烂多彩"}
[00:20.660]And do the things I want
{"随心所欲不踌躇"}
[00:25.260]You think you got the best of me
{"你以为已将我彻底击败"}
[00:27.260]Think you had the last laugh
{"以为赢得最终嘲笑"}
[00:29.350]Bet you think that everything good is gone
{"打赌你认为所有美好都已消散"}
[00:33.450]Think you left me broken down
{"以为留我破碎不堪"}
[00:35.470]Think that I'd come running back
{"以为我会乞求归来"}
[00:37.590]Baby you don't know me, cause you're dead wrong
{"亲爱的你根本不了解我 大错特错"}
[00:42.000]What doesn't kill you makes you stronger
{"杀不死你的让你更强大"}
[00:44.590]Stand a little taller
{"脊梁挺得更笔直"}
[00:46.430]Doesn't mean I'm lonely when I'm alone
{"独处不代表我会寂寞"}
[00:50.190]What doesn't kill you makes a fighter
{"杀不死你的让你成战士"}
[00:52.740]footsteps even lighter
{"步伐反而更轻盈"}
[00:54.920]Doesn't mean I'm over cause you'r gone
{"你离开不代表故事终结"}
[00:58.400]What doesn't kill you makes you stronger, stronger
